    "summary": "The user is asking for advice on how to frame a scientific paper with an intentionally small sample size (n=12) to avoid skepticism from peer reviewers during a symposium submission. The assistant provides several strategies to pivot the narrative from statistical power to qualitative depth or signal quality to make the study appear more substantial.",
